  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together jagged hot sauce, olive oil, garlic, and salt.",
    "3. Add the beef strips to the marinade and mix well.",
    "4. Thread the marinated beef, onion, bell pepper, and cilantro onto the skewers.",
    "5. Brush the grill with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "6. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until the beef reaches 145°F (63°C) for medium-rare.",
    "7. Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "8. Serve hot with additional jagged hot sauce on the side."
